            <title><![CDATA[News Wrap: Court rules Trump needs Congress to approve White House ballroom]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/news-wrap-court-rules-trump-needs-congress-to-approve-white-house-ballroom</link>
            <description><![CDATA[In our news wrap Friday, a federal appeals court ruled that President Trump can't continue building his $400 million White House ballroom without congressional approval, Trump is reviving his push to remove Lisa Cook from the Federal Reserve Board of Governors and a student in Thailand shot and killed at least seven people today, including five at his high school, outside of Bangkok.]]></description>
