            <title><![CDATA[What's holding up the Iran-Oman proposal to reopen the Strait of Hormuz]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/whats-holding-up-the-iran-oman-proposal-to-reopen-the-strait-of-hormuz</link>
            <description><![CDATA[There is a new partnership in the Middle East and South Asia. Saudi Arabia, Turkey and Pakistan signed an agreement similar to NATO's Article 5, pledging that a strike against one of them would be considered a strike against all of them. But despite reports that it was close, no deal was announced between the United States and Iran. Nick Schifrin explains. ]]></description>
